...               0.4        FB2225    vincent.boulet@nokia.com              Introducing vendor file configuration
...               0.5        FB2226    vincent.boulet@nokia.com              Reducing of ue_2 throughput configuration
...               0.6        FB2301    vincent.boulet@nokia.com              Updating path for custom config
...               0.7        FB2303    ying.yw.wu@nokia.com                  Add vendor file param maxNumWbStreamPrbL1Sp
...               1.0        FB2314    vincent.boulet@nokia.com              Add PRB pooling verifications to TC-Cell-Setup-Endurance
